// Title: JXA In-memory Execution Via OSAScript
// ID: f1408a58-0e94-4165-b80a-da9f96cf6fc3
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Sohan G (D4rkCiph3r)
// Date: 2023-01-31
// Tags: attack.t1059.002, attack.t1059.007, attack.execution
// Description: Detects possible malicious execution of JXA in-memory via OSAScript
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where ((((process.command_line like "*_ -l *" and process.command_line like "*_JavaScript*")) or (process.command_line like "*_.js*")) and ((process.command_line like "*_osascript*" and process.command_line like "*_ -e *" and process.command_line like "*_eval*" and process.command_line like "*_NSData.dataWithContentsOfURL*")))
